    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-packed adventure, you take on the role of a space traveler who lands on an uncharted planet filled with dangerous enemies and deadly traps. Armed with a powerful plasma blaster and a rocket launcher, your mission is to explore the unknown while fighting your way through waves of hostile creatures. But there's a catch\u2014you only have five lives to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect plasma to fuel your weapons, as every shot counts. Your reflexes, strategy, and skill will determine your fate. If you successfully clear a level, your time is saved, allowing you to continue your journey. However, if you fail, your progress resets, and you'll need to start the level over. Can you conquer the challenges that lie ahead and survive the planet's perils?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, dynamic gameplay that will keep you on your toes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of enemies to defeat as you advance through increasingly difficult levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique plasma-based weapon system: collect plasma to replenish your ammo and power up your arsenal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging traps that will test your reflexes and strategy</p></li></ul>",
